      <h3 id="_new_features_smproductname_version_24" class="group scroll-mt-20">New features Red Hat OpenShift Service Mesh version 2.4<a href="#_new_features_smproductname_version_24" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
